### 3. Detailed Module Specs (No Fees)

#### 3.1 Hat Model
Fields: hatTitle, username, verifiedName, orbit (open custom), skills, hatType, country+flag+currency, lga, motto 80 max, media, priceMin/Max/rate, availability, rating, bookings, likes, commentsCount, orbitScore, jobsPosted/spent/events for Client.

#### 3.2 BentoCard
- Pill: Blue #0A13E6 Talent, Black Client.
- Same component, two flows: Book Flow vs Apply Flow.
- Swap positions button.
- Responsive: 96% width max 1150px desktop, 100vw 100vh full-screen on Android <768px.

#### 3.3 My Hats
- Personal collection, 260px grid, list toggle, edit/delete, status sync everywhere.

#### 3.4 Trust
- Escrow = priceMin.
- No platform charges for now (removed).
- Contacts locked until escrow funded.

#### 3.5 Search
- Search Talents... ^username LGA, Search Clients... ^username LGA

